Package: pvg-mesa
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Guesthouse contributors <144541403+s3k000@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@, libgbm1, libegl1, libgles2, libgl1, libvulkan1
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Description: Guesthouse: Vulkan and GL for the Mac's graphics device
 Mesa with KosmicKrisp and a bridge to the pvg kernel driver as the Vulkan
 driver, and Zink over it for EGL, GLES, GL with GLX, and GBM, installed in
 /opt/pvg-mesa beside Ubuntu's Mesa. GBM's backend for the pvg device, the
 Vulkan driver file, and glvnd's vendor file while a card of pvg's is there
 make it the one used on that device; without it Ubuntu's Mesa answers.
 .
 Built from @SOURCE@.
